            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "willbake4shoes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for Father's Day and it was delicious! It is so easy and refreshing, four of us finished it pretty quickly! I put the concentrate in my pitcher and then added a little ginger ale and stirred it together. I added the rest of the ginger ale after that. This is a great summer time refresher!"
          },
