            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We didn't bother with the oranges and the cherries. We loved the combination of the orange juice and ginger ale. Great breakfast drink!",
            "datePublished": "2012-11-07T12:12:12.207Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
